docs/ux-design-specification.md:332:- does leaving feel calm, strained, or disrupted right now?
docs/ux-design-specification.md:382:Freshness and degraded-trust cues should be clear but visually disciplined. They must help users understand when confidence narrows without introducing panic, clutter, or visual instability.
