codex
I found the main mismatch: the fixture snapshot already marked `cycles-scooters` as disrupted, so the builder was inheriting a second disruption that the new tests quite reasonably weren’t expecting. That accidental baseline undermines Story 2.3’s “derive from live evidence” rule, so I’m neutralizing the fixture and keeping disruption emphasis driven by explicit snapshot state instead.
