Implemented Story 2.3 and completed the dev-story workflow. The dashboard now carries first-class disruption modeling through the canonical snapshot, server builder, presenter, and public UI, so overall disruption and local mode disruption read clearly without turning the screen into an alert surface. The story artifact is updated to `review` at [2-3-surface-serious-disruption-without-breaking-composure.md](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/2-3-surface-serious-disruption-without-breaking-composure.md), and sprint tracking is synced in [sprint-status.yaml](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/docs/sprint-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml).

Key implementation landed in [dashboard-snapshot.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/contracts/dashboard-snapshot.js), [build-dashboard-snapshot.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/dashboard/build-dashboard-snapshot.js), [dashboard-presenter.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/dashboard/presenters/dashboard-presenter.js), [AtmosphericHeader.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/dashboard/components/AtmosphericHeader.tsx), [ModeSummaryCard.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/dashboard/components/ModeSummaryCard.tsx), and [globals.css](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/globals.css). Coverage was extended in [dashboard.presenter.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/dashboard.presenter.test.mjs), [dashboard.live-path.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/dashboard.live-path.test.mjs), and [startup-smoke.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs).

